    {
      "id": "1557336745715040357",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-07T10:20:14.096+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "we have that little sliver, that was causing all kinds of problems. They asked that we have no features that are taller than they are wide. No sliver there would be best. but that's something we already knew. \nI asked for the pictures they showed me a bunch, I will share them when I do. You could plainly see the one good cut and then the second cut came along and it was all crap.",
